/*******************************************************************
  DroidWorks USA - CYD Face + Debug Surface  v0.4
  ESP32-2432S028 (Cheap Yellow Display) — classic ESP32, NOT S3

  Portrait face is home. Debug pages remain available.

  Pages:
    0  Face         - eyes / distance / orientation (portrait)
    1  Nodes        - expected ROS nodes, up / down
    2  Topics       - key topics, active + last value
    3  Motion       - PIR / RCWL / fused
    4  Orientation  - tilt / shock / roll / pitch
    5  Radar        - ToF beam + US cone
    6  System       - link / uptime / packets

  Touch (portrait):
    tap left 1/3  = previous page
    tap right 1/3 = next page
    hold ~1s      = jump to Face

  Board (Arduino IDE / PlatformIO):
    Board: ESP32 Dev Module
    Upload speed: 921600 (or 460800 if flaky)
    Flash: 4MB (minimum)
    PSRAM: disabled (classic CYD has none)

  Libraries:
    TFT_eSPI (CYD User_Setup / ILI9341)
    XPT2046_Touchscreen
    PubSubClient
    ArduinoJson

  Needs: dw_logo.h next to this sketch
 *******************************************************************/

